+/* =====================================================================
+   SUNFLOWER THEME — phase 9: cutting the cake + final celebration (cake.html). STYLING ONLY.
+   Knife, dotted guide, drag/tap/keyboard cut, cut detection, slice animation, layers, filling, buttons, messages and timings are untouched.
